  "contentHtml": "<p>2시간은 잡아야해요.</p><p>참조가 될 팝업북도 준비하시구요~</p><p>&#160;</p><p>힘 단원은 학생들이 분단별로 나누어 peer teaching 했습니다.</p><p>2명은 남고 2명은 이동해서 서로가 서로를 가르쳐주는 방식으로. 공부해서 남주자.</p><p>학습지는 제가 제공하고 자신이 맡은 파트를 공부해서 가르쳐 주는거죠.</p><p>단원 마무리 단계에서 했던 활동.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/afc3e8820f699d9ace4117fa18cd1449a44ff5c4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/afc3e8820f699d9ace4117fa18cd1449a44ff5c4\" data-orgin-width=\"3120\" data-origin-height=\"3120\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/923cda561b151d713b589f265d1a54de2c8be754\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/923cda561b151d713b589f265d1a54de2c8be754\" data-orgin-width=\"3120\" data-origin-height=\"3120\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a5fbe95683a6a9efd0349cab2d7bde40d3f0bf62\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a5fbe95683a6a9efd0349cab2d7bde40d3f0bf62\" data-orgin-width=\"3120\" data-origin-height=\"3120\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4d4aee1d911376cc603958af4b6c213e32c7688e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4d4aee1d911376cc603958af4b6c213e32c7688e\" data-orgin-width=\"3120\" data-origin-height=\"3120\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
